{
  "id": "ss.enemy.spray",
  "name": "Spray",
  "description": "What a Sprayer empties down the passage: not a bolt but a jet — a round head of acid with the stream still drawing out behind it into a point, and two beads shaken off the end. Lighter teal than the Gland's spit (`$spore.light` over a `$spore` core) and a different shape on purpose: the two used to throw the same drawing, `ss.enemy.shot`, and a crowd of both was a crowd of one bead. A Gland spits one thing it has aimed; a Sprayer points its tail and pumps, and this is drawn as what comes out of a pump. Drawn pointing +x, head first; the game rotates it to its heading.",
